WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:28.310
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:28.310 --> 01:30.838
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Yuewen Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.858 --> 01:34.378
[Episode 36]

01:34.720 --> 01:36.880
If you do it without his permission,

01:37.200 --> 01:38.679
I'm afraid Father will

01:39.280 --> 01:40.559
be enraged.

01:40.700 --> 01:41.860
If you wish to achieve great feats,

01:41.879 --> 01:43.600
you can't afford to be indecisive.

01:45.319 --> 01:47.160
I don't think this path
will turn out well.

01:48.679 --> 01:50.170
But I will pretend I know nothing

01:50.190 --> 01:51.570
or hear nothing about it,

01:52.440 --> 01:54.039
nor will I secretly report

01:54.200 --> 01:55.360
to Father.

01:59.399 --> 02:00.479
Thank you.

02:02.830 --> 02:04.360
But I really don't hold with it.

02:04.910 --> 02:06.000
What about you?

02:06.119 --> 02:06.860
Me neither.

02:06.880 --> 02:08.360
You don't hold with this too?

02:10.439 --> 02:11.519
No, I don't.

02:12.399 --> 02:13.659
Superficially,

02:13.679 --> 02:16.320
it seems to harm the imperial family
and benefit the populace.

02:16.600 --> 02:18.180
He's the royal,

02:18.200 --> 02:20.160
it's understandable
he doesn't hold with it.

02:20.560 --> 02:22.120
But why did you think the same too?

02:25.360 --> 02:26.560
To be honest,

02:26.680 --> 02:28.539
I don't quite understand
what you have said

02:28.559 --> 02:29.900
but I believe the choice you made

02:29.920 --> 02:31.270
must be right, Master.

02:31.679 --> 02:33.000
Then why do you disagree?

02:33.600 --> 02:35.379
It doesn't really matter
what is right or wrong

02:35.399 --> 02:36.799
in this world.

02:37.559 --> 02:38.780
The path you chose

02:38.800 --> 02:40.380
will affect many people's interests.

02:40.400 --> 02:42.120
I'm worried you will make enemies

02:42.320 --> 02:43.700
down the road

02:43.720 --> 02:45.099
and many obstacles might await.

02:45.119 --> 02:47.239
People always say

02:47.470 --> 02:49.320
that right and wrong aren't important.

02:50.279 --> 02:52.720
But if people always carry this thought

02:53.160 --> 02:55.320
and no one tries to make a change,

02:57.119 --> 02:58.499
the fire in the Three Great Workshops

02:58.519 --> 03:00.079
and the Shijia Town

03:00.519 --> 03:02.239
will never cease.

03:03.119 --> 03:04.199
Master,

03:04.239 --> 03:05.799
though I disagree with this path,

03:05.839 --> 03:07.330
I'm willing to accompany you

03:07.350 --> 03:09.060
even if I will be burned to ashes.

03:09.080 --> 03:10.280
I won't regret it.

03:12.820 --> 03:14.239
I think the same as Chanli.

03:15.480 --> 03:17.639
Is that really what you think?

03:19.399 --> 03:20.170
I knew you were crazy.

03:20.190 --> 03:21.959
But I didn't expect you
to be this crazy.

03:22.080 --> 03:24.100
You are even dragging the prince
along with you.

03:24.120 --> 03:25.340
You were eavesdropping on us.

03:25.360 --> 03:26.840
I didn't mean to.

03:27.640 --> 03:28.839
Master,

03:29.040 --> 03:31.120
we will take our leave.

03:31.839 --> 03:32.239
Let's leave.

03:32.239 --> 03:33.720
We haven't played the Go yet.

03:36.640 --> 03:37.720
Sit.

03:40.399 --> 03:42.280
Why? What's the matter?

03:44.070 --> 03:45.400
Just checking on you.

03:45.640 --> 03:47.840
I'm worried Yun Zhilan
might come back again.

03:48.679 --> 03:49.160
Thanks.

03:49.170 --> 03:50.280
Don't mention it.

03:50.999 --> 03:52.719
I'm afraid the path you mentioned

03:52.719 --> 03:54.860
is very likely to lead you to death.

03:54.880 --> 03:56.460
There would be more
than just Yun Zhilan.

03:56.480 --> 03:57.559
That's why I would like you

03:57.559 --> 03:59.600
to stay here for a few more days.

04:00.160 --> 04:01.300
With your skills,

04:01.320 --> 04:02.580
except for grandmasters,

04:02.600 --> 04:04.720
other ninth-level
won't be able to kill you.

04:07.620 --> 04:09.160
After the assassination
at the Hanging Temple,

04:09.160 --> 04:10.600
my qi flow burst the meridians

04:10.600 --> 04:12.200
and scattered across my body.

04:12.399 --> 04:14.419
It hasn't recovered until now.

04:14.439 --> 04:15.540
So I need you.

04:15.560 --> 04:16.940
Finally, you are admitting this.

04:16.960 --> 04:18.599
I never wanted to hide it.

04:19.679 --> 04:21.700
It was a different case
in your letter, though.

04:21.720 --> 04:23.559
Well, the letter will be read
by many people.

04:23.560 --> 04:25.150
There are things
I can only tell you face-to-face.

04:25.160 --> 04:26.880
Why didn't you hide it from me?

04:26.920 --> 04:28.340
I feel sorry.

04:28.360 --> 04:29.440
Why is that so?

04:29.920 --> 04:31.279
You are my friend.

04:36.639 --> 04:38.519
We only met a few times.

04:38.999 --> 04:39.900
You never know.

04:39.920 --> 04:42.179
Wondrous things happen between people.

04:42.199 --> 04:43.430
Some you know for life

04:43.450 --> 04:44.859
can only be no more
than an acquaintance.

04:44.879 --> 04:46.059
For some whom you briefly meet,

04:46.079 --> 04:47.760
you would entrust your life to them.

04:48.759 --> 04:51.440
You probably think this is sentimental.

04:51.480 --> 04:53.940
I have encountered many people
in my life,

04:53.960 --> 04:55.940
but only a few can be
considered friends.

04:55.960 --> 04:57.279
You are one of them.

05:01.800 --> 05:03.270
This is indeed sentimental.

05:04.040 --> 05:04.800
I think so too.

05:04.800 --> 05:06.240
I won't say that anymore.

05:07.480 --> 05:09.219
So you demand for One Heaven Knack

05:09.239 --> 05:10.680
to recultivate your qi?

05:11.759 --> 05:13.639
I'm grasping at anything.

05:17.199 --> 05:18.320
Bring that over.

05:29.119 --> 05:30.399
What are you doing?

05:31.280 --> 05:32.360
Grind ink.

05:40.720 --> 05:42.240
Keep on. Don't stop.

05:53.775 --> 05:55.700
[One Heaven Knack]

05:55.720 --> 05:57.000
What did you change?

05:58.720 --> 06:00.360
Master did something to it.

06:00.879 --> 06:02.059
Is this manual fake?

06:02.079 --> 06:03.059
Not entirely.

06:03.079 --> 06:03.999
Most of it is real.

06:03.999 --> 06:05.680
Only a few parts are altered.

06:06.559 --> 06:08.530
What would happen to me

06:08.550 --> 06:09.539
if I followed the altered one?

06:09.559 --> 06:10.720
You could regain your qi

06:10.720 --> 06:12.390
but wouldn't reach the ninth level.

06:13.720 --> 06:16.030
You might even become an idiot
if accidents happen.

06:16.160 --> 06:17.659
Evil!

06:17.679 --> 06:19.659
Didn't Ku He say
this is given by my mother?

06:19.679 --> 06:20.380
It is.

06:20.400 --> 06:22.160
How could he return an altered version
to the owner?

06:22.160 --> 06:24.219
After all, you are an important official
of the Qing State.

06:24.239 --> 06:25.440
Please understand.

06:26.759 --> 06:28.539
Hold on. You know about this.

06:28.559 --> 06:29.500
Of course I do.

06:29.520 --> 06:31.079
Why didn't you remind me?

06:31.639 --> 06:33.419
Trust goes both ways.

06:33.439 --> 06:35.500
I wouldn't dare be frank with you
if you didn't be honest.

06:35.520 --> 06:37.500
You figured that something was wrong
with my qi flow.

06:37.520 --> 06:38.859
You wrote to demand the knack.

06:38.879 --> 06:39.960
Even a fool would figure

06:39.960 --> 06:41.580
that you are in trouble.

06:41.600 --> 06:43.380
If you hide the truth from me

06:43.400 --> 06:45.700
and become an idiot, blame yourself.

06:45.720 --> 06:47.399
Do you have to be so ruthless?

06:49.600 --> 06:51.179
Given our identities,

06:51.199 --> 06:53.279
being friends is beyond us.

06:56.079 --> 06:57.759
What are you going to explain to Ku He

06:57.800 --> 06:58.890
if you change this back?

06:58.910 --> 07:00.020
I don't have to explain anything.

07:00.040 --> 07:02.320
Disciples don't always follow
the master's order.

07:05.350 --> 07:06.760
I really appreciate it.

07:06.920 --> 07:08.790
There are more good folks in the world.

07:10.119 --> 07:11.519
How sentimental.

07:12.639 --> 07:13.759
Give me the brush.

07:14.759 --> 07:15.210
Why?

07:15.230 --> 07:16.839
I will draw some paintings for you.

07:18.199 --> 07:19.279
What paintings?

07:20.960 --> 07:23.320
The Dominant Qi manual
I gave you earlier

07:24.520 --> 07:26.199
was missing some paintings.

07:26.360 --> 07:29.199
If you force the cultivation,
you might bleed from every orifice.

07:35.199 --> 07:36.460
When can this world

07:36.480 --> 07:39.519
be less deceitful?

07:39.600 --> 07:40.739
Same for you.

07:40.759 --> 07:42.159
Let's try to be kind.

08:01.319 --> 08:01.859
Mr. Fan,

08:01.879 --> 08:03.639
look who's here.

08:08.400 --> 08:10.180
I, Deng Ziyue
of Imperial Inspectorate First Division,

08:10.199 --> 08:12.040
greet you, Inspector.

08:12.239 --> 08:13.600
Deng, we have known each other for long.

08:13.600 --> 08:14.780
There's no need for that.

08:14.800 --> 08:15.739
Come on and sit.

08:15.759 --> 08:17.480
We should observe formalities.

08:18.879 --> 08:19.959
Qinian.

08:23.639 --> 08:25.120
Where is your mustache?

08:27.559 --> 08:29.530
Well, Mr. Fan ordered me

08:29.550 --> 08:31.340
to investigate
the Ming family in Jiangnan.

08:31.360 --> 08:32.580
Since this is an undercover mission,

08:32.599 --> 08:35.079
I think I need a complete disguise.

08:35.559 --> 08:37.640
Come. Have some water.

08:37.800 --> 08:38.999
Thank you, Qinian.

08:39.160 --> 08:40.599
Let's get to the business.

08:41.559 --> 08:42.850
As per your order,

08:42.870 --> 08:44.780
I disguised myself as a refugee
and went to Jiangnan.

08:44.800 --> 08:47.079
The Ming family recruited me
as expected.

08:47.120 --> 08:49.119
However, they were very suspicious.

08:49.160 --> 08:51.520
I was working tirelessly
in the first month.

08:51.760 --> 08:54.280
I suppose
they were investigating my identity.

08:54.719 --> 08:56.040
The First Division and Fourth Division

08:56.040 --> 08:57.999
crafted this identity for you.

08:58.040 --> 08:59.800
It should be flawless, right?

08:59.920 --> 09:01.119
Indeed.

09:01.439 --> 09:03.560
By the second month,

09:03.719 --> 09:05.380
the guard loosened.

09:05.400 --> 09:06.740
I found one chance

09:06.760 --> 09:08.879
and showed them my skills in accounting.

09:09.359 --> 09:10.819
Hence, they began to accept me.

09:10.839 --> 09:11.780
Finally,

09:11.800 --> 09:13.540
I entered the Three Great Workshops.

09:15.520 --> 09:19.140
So the Three Great Workshops
still exist.

09:19.160 --> 09:20.400
Of course.

09:20.880 --> 09:21.330
Mr. Fan,

09:21.350 --> 09:23.740
the Ming family has secretly transferred
the Three Great Workshops,

09:23.760 --> 09:25.299
the secretaries and builders

09:25.319 --> 09:27.239
out of the city long ago.

09:27.640 --> 09:29.999
I knew they swapped it.

09:30.719 --> 09:33.040
So many innocent lives were killed.

09:34.330 --> 09:35.380
Mr. Fan, look at this.

09:35.400 --> 09:38.230
[20 li southwest of Hangzhou City]
The latest location of the warehouse.

09:39.079 --> 09:40.159
Mr. Fan,

09:40.520 --> 09:42.020
I reckon

09:42.040 --> 09:44.699
the Ming family set the fire
and killed the people,

09:44.719 --> 09:46.140
it is the worst sin.

09:46.160 --> 09:48.199
They must be punished.

09:50.719 --> 09:52.320
The Ming family must be punished,

09:52.359 --> 09:53.640
but not now.

09:53.839 --> 09:55.880
The Ming family isn't
our only concern for now,

09:55.880 --> 09:58.760
but also the peace
of Jiangnan for the future decades.

10:01.040 --> 10:02.020
Mr. Fan,

10:02.040 --> 10:04.119
what should I do next?

10:04.439 --> 10:05.900
Did anyone notice you

10:05.920 --> 10:07.360
when you left the warehouse?

10:08.280 --> 10:09.539
Head back now

10:09.559 --> 10:11.239
and pretend nothing happened.

10:12.319 --> 10:14.179
The undercover mission has begun.

10:14.199 --> 10:15.760
Continue to conceal yourself.

10:15.880 --> 10:17.719
We wouldn't know

10:18.630 --> 10:21.000
what variables will await
the Three Great Workshops.

10:22.599 --> 10:23.579
As you command,

10:23.599 --> 10:24.679
Mr. Fan.

10:25.160 --> 10:26.240
Qinian,

10:26.440 --> 10:27.800
please protect Mr. Fan.

10:28.079 --> 10:29.280
Don't worry.

10:29.479 --> 10:30.559
Deng,

10:31.199 --> 10:33.879
you ought to keep yourself safe.

10:39.199 --> 10:40.279
You may go.

10:41.510 --> 10:42.879
No need to send me off.

10:51.839 --> 10:54.320
Did Shadow turn up afterward?

10:54.520 --> 10:58.020
After his fight with Yun Zhilan,

10:58.040 --> 10:59.800
he is nowhere to be seen.

11:01.839 --> 11:03.059
Never mind him, then.

11:03.079 --> 11:04.540
Tomorrow, we are leaving the city

11:04.560 --> 11:06.390
to reclaim the Three Great Workshops.

11:09.000 --> 11:10.119
You see,

11:10.400 --> 11:13.140
your qi is gone, right?

11:13.160 --> 11:15.839
I can only run.

11:16.000 --> 11:16.719
Why don't we

11:16.719 --> 11:19.440
bring Miss Duoduo along?

11:19.479 --> 11:20.699
No.

11:20.719 --> 11:22.299
She is the Holy Maiden of Northern Qi.

11:22.319 --> 11:24.590
If she is there
when I reclaim the Three Great Workshops,

11:24.599 --> 11:26.270
people might make a fuss about it.

11:27.559 --> 11:28.459
Wang,

11:28.479 --> 11:31.280
we can only rely on ourselves
when it really comes down to it.

11:34.679 --> 11:36.719
As you say.

11:51.199 --> 11:53.100
Fan Xian left the city on horseback?

11:53.120 --> 11:54.659
The news just came in.

11:54.679 --> 11:56.590
The direction they are heading

11:56.610 --> 11:58.959
is the current warehouse
of the Three Great Workshops.

11:59.280 --> 12:00.999
The location of the warehouse

12:01.160 --> 12:02.319
should be highly confidential.

12:02.320 --> 12:04.320
Someone must have
leaked the information.

12:07.040 --> 12:09.419
Only the two of them left the city?

12:09.439 --> 12:10.999
Initially.

12:49.520 --> 12:50.459
There are cavalries too?

12:50.479 --> 12:52.790
It's the Black Cavalries
of the Imperial Inspectorate.

12:55.280 --> 12:57.599
Didn't Xie Bi'an guarantee

12:58.000 --> 13:01.199
Fan Xian's death in two days?

13:01.640 --> 13:03.500
Two days are up.

13:03.520 --> 13:04.999
Even Yun Zhilan failed,

13:06.240 --> 13:07.699
who else could kill Fan Xian?

13:07.719 --> 13:09.079
Yun Zhilan

13:09.439 --> 13:11.280
isn't a grandmaster.

13:12.599 --> 13:13.939
A grandmaster is stepping in?

13:13.959 --> 13:16.800
That's why Li Yunrui personally invited

13:16.800 --> 13:18.800
the grandmaster.

13:22.599 --> 13:24.199
There are four grandmasters.

13:25.199 --> 13:26.560
Which one

13:28.319 --> 13:29.839
is involved?

13:50.000 --> 13:51.220
Mr. Shadow.

13:51.240 --> 13:53.579
I thought you would keep avoiding me.

13:53.599 --> 13:55.579
We will deal with that later.

13:55.599 --> 13:56.579
You should go back now.

13:56.599 --> 13:58.299
We can't go back now.

13:58.319 --> 14:01.140
We are getting close
to the Three Great Workshops.

14:01.160 --> 14:04.760
Ye Liuyun is heading to Suzhou now.

14:07.880 --> 14:10.320
Ku He is in Northern Qi,

14:10.920 --> 14:13.160
while Sigu Jian doesn't want to meddle.

14:13.199 --> 14:15.640
Only one person is left.

14:18.160 --> 14:19.299
Ye Liuyun.

14:19.319 --> 14:22.179
Ye Liuyun is the grandmaster
of the Qing State.

14:22.199 --> 14:23.990
Why would he attack someone on his side?

14:24.010 --> 14:25.550
After the assassination
at the Hanging Temple,

14:25.560 --> 14:27.079
the Ye family was expelled
from the Capital.

14:27.079 --> 14:29.199
It has nothing to do with Mr. Fan.

14:29.199 --> 14:30.819
That's His Majesty's order.

14:30.839 --> 14:31.740
Right.

14:31.760 --> 14:34.760
Ye Liuyun is taking revenge
against the imperial family.

14:39.599 --> 14:42.380
Mr. Fan, let's go back to the city.

14:42.400 --> 14:45.140
Ye Liuyun won't attack us
with many people around,

14:45.160 --> 14:46.240
right?

14:46.719 --> 14:47.900
If not,

14:47.920 --> 14:50.440
let's take a ship and leave Jiangnan.

14:55.650 --> 14:57.860
The grandmaster's strength
is far above ordinary people's.

14:57.880 --> 15:00.140
Those behind you are unable to stop him.

15:00.160 --> 15:01.280
If I were to go back to the city now,

15:01.280 --> 15:04.370
the Ming family would transfer
the Three Great Workshops again.

15:04.390 --> 15:05.699
If they learn from this lesson,

15:05.719 --> 15:08.000
they will dismantle
the Three Great Workshops

15:08.010 --> 15:09.140
and scatter them across Jiangnan.

15:09.160 --> 15:09.900
Which means

15:09.920 --> 15:11.740
if I want to reclaim
the Three Great Workshops,

15:11.760 --> 15:12.800
I have to act fast.

15:12.800 --> 15:14.860
And now is the only chance.

15:14.880 --> 15:16.719
But who will handle Ye Liuyun?

15:19.920 --> 15:21.330
How soon will he arrive?

15:21.350 --> 15:22.879
He is still far away from here.

15:23.079 --> 15:24.780
But with a grandmaster's skill,

15:24.800 --> 15:26.239
it only takes a few hours.

15:28.479 --> 15:29.920
It's my mother's property,

15:30.359 --> 15:31.680
I must reclaim it.

15:32.839 --> 15:33.919
Mr. Fan,

15:34.559 --> 15:36.939
I should've asked for more salary.

15:36.959 --> 15:38.640
You are getting yourselves killed!

18:02.559 --> 18:03.240
Who are they?

18:03.240 --> 18:04.480
Be careful.

18:08.839 --> 18:09.919
Over here.

18:18.960 --> 18:20.040
I got it.

18:23.919 --> 18:25.639
Don't move! Stop!

18:25.919 --> 18:26.780
- Don't move!
- Stop!

18:26.800 --> 18:27.880
Everyone stops!

18:28.200 --> 18:29.280
Don't move!

18:29.670 --> 18:31.030
Stop what you are doing!

18:37.000 --> 18:38.200
You go over there.

18:53.840 --> 18:54.700
Who's out there?

18:54.720 --> 18:55.920
Who are those people?

18:56.559 --> 18:57.639
Come with me.

19:00.159 --> 19:01.239
Come on.

19:02.000 --> 19:03.080
Where are they?

19:05.319 --> 19:06.400
What people? Where are they?

19:06.420 --> 19:07.790
They are at the entrance.

19:07.839 --> 19:08.819
What's the matter?

19:08.839 --> 19:09.919
Move.

19:10.559 --> 19:11.760
Move.

19:12.040 --> 19:13.399
Hurry up.

19:15.559 --> 19:16.879
Come on. Quick.

19:22.919 --> 19:24.760
Don't move.

19:29.119 --> 19:30.439
Don't move.

19:30.720 --> 19:31.700
Nobody moves.

19:31.720 --> 19:32.460
Don't move.

19:32.480 --> 19:33.740
Stay still first, everyone.

19:33.760 --> 19:34.960
Put it down.

19:40.720 --> 19:41.800
You...

19:42.040 --> 19:43.740
Who are you?

19:43.760 --> 19:46.280
This is the private property
of the Ming family.

19:47.040 --> 19:48.940
How dare you trespass riding horses!

19:48.960 --> 19:50.299
Do you have no respect for the law?

19:50.319 --> 19:51.839
How dare you ignore the law!

19:52.520 --> 19:53.399
What did you just say?

19:53.399 --> 19:54.800
I don't quite follow.

19:55.200 --> 19:57.200
What is this place?

19:58.879 --> 20:00.780
I made it very clear.

20:00.800 --> 20:02.599
This is the property of the Ming family.

20:04.680 --> 20:05.760
Wang.

20:08.000 --> 20:10.560
Imperial Treasury
Transportation Bureau Case.

20:11.720 --> 20:15.139
The secretary of the Imperial Treasury
Transportation Bureau's First Workshop,

20:15.159 --> 20:16.899
Xiao Jing, is it you?

20:16.919 --> 20:17.999
It's me.

20:18.040 --> 20:21.370
This records all your crimes

20:21.390 --> 20:23.520
from the first year of the Qing State
until now.

20:23.800 --> 20:24.579
What?

20:24.599 --> 20:26.299
You are imposing crimes I didn't do.

20:26.319 --> 20:27.879
Just shut up and listen.

20:28.260 --> 20:30.079
In the third month
of the second year of the Qing State,

20:30.079 --> 20:32.119
Xiao Jing concealed the death cases
of the copper mining accident

20:32.119 --> 20:33.980
and embezzled the subsidies of the dead
for five years.

20:34.000 --> 20:35.080
The total is

20:35.319 --> 20:38.119
13,700 taels.

20:40.770 --> 20:43.140
On the ninth day of the seventh month
of the fourth year of the Qing State,

20:43.159 --> 20:46.059
Xiao Jing bribed
the chief clerk of Suzhou

20:46.079 --> 20:49.619
and procured 700 mu of fine crop field
at an extremely low price.

20:49.639 --> 20:51.660
In the first month
of the sixth year of the Qing State,

20:51.680 --> 20:55.819
Xiao Jing led the other two secretaries

20:55.839 --> 20:57.460
and other treasurers

20:57.480 --> 21:00.879
to owing workers over ten thousand taels.

21:01.200 --> 21:02.339
This caused a commotion

21:02.359 --> 21:05.679
that resulted in 14 deaths
and more than 50 injuries.

21:05.720 --> 21:06.260
You!

21:06.280 --> 21:09.220
Embezzlement of dead subsidies
and bribery are negotiable.

21:09.240 --> 21:10.460
But death cases

21:10.480 --> 21:12.579
are unforgivable.

21:12.599 --> 21:15.830
According to the Qing State's law,
you should be executed.

21:16.919 --> 21:18.320
How could you convict me

21:18.760 --> 21:20.280
without evidence?

21:20.720 --> 21:22.639
This is the statement and evidence.

21:23.000 --> 21:23.955
Read it yourself.

21:23.975 --> 21:25.295
[Statement]

21:30.559 --> 21:31.919
If you want to convict me,

21:32.119 --> 21:34.599
take it to the court...

21:44.480 --> 21:48.440
The Imperial Inspectorate's inspector
has a duty for judgment and execution.

21:48.450 --> 21:49.950
With the witnesses
and conclusive evidence,

21:49.960 --> 21:51.380
criminals are to be executed
according to the law.

21:51.399 --> 21:52.839
No trial is needed.

21:56.119 --> 21:57.199
Can anyone

21:58.079 --> 22:00.200
tell me

22:00.639 --> 22:02.679
what place this is?

22:03.399 --> 22:04.700
Mr. Xiao is dead.

22:04.720 --> 22:06.800
The Imperial Inspectorate
is as advertised.

22:06.839 --> 22:07.919
Sir,

22:08.240 --> 22:09.320
this is...

22:10.000 --> 22:11.280
this is...

22:12.080 --> 22:14.070
The personal property
of the Ming family.

22:17.280 --> 22:20.579
The secretary of the Imperial Treasury
Transportation Bureau's Second Workshop,

22:20.599 --> 22:22.760
Ma Xiongjian, is it you?

22:23.639 --> 22:24.700
It's me.

22:24.720 --> 22:25.919
Listen carefully.

22:27.000 --> 22:28.240
Ever since you began your service,

22:28.240 --> 22:30.639
out of your twelve concubines,

22:30.760 --> 22:34.099
nine were abducted,

22:34.119 --> 22:38.560
and two were widowers
whose husbands you killed.

22:38.919 --> 22:42.079
In addition, the riot
in the sixth year of the Qing State

22:42.200 --> 22:45.180
was planned
by Ma Xiongjian and Xiao Jing.

22:45.200 --> 22:47.139
According to the Qing State's law,

22:47.159 --> 22:49.560
you should face concurrent sentences
of execution.

22:50.200 --> 22:51.260
Sir!

22:51.280 --> 22:52.440
Sir, please spare my life!

22:52.460 --> 22:53.319
Sir, please spare my life!

22:53.319 --> 22:54.339
I won't do that again!

22:54.359 --> 22:55.639
Sir, please spare me!

22:55.639 --> 22:56.040
Sir!

22:56.040 --> 22:57.120
Execute him.

23:03.399 --> 23:05.240
Everyone, listen carefully.

23:05.480 --> 23:06.520
I just arrived in Jiangnan,

23:06.520 --> 23:08.439
but that doesn't mean I know nothing.

23:08.760 --> 23:10.330
Nothing in this world

23:10.350 --> 23:12.439
can be hidden
from the Imperial Inspectorate.

23:13.440 --> 23:14.800
There is another

23:14.800 --> 23:17.399
chief clerk with the surname Hu.
Where is he?

23:18.399 --> 23:19.480
Here. I'm here.

23:27.870 --> 23:29.740
I, Hu Jinlin,
secretary of the Third Workshop,

23:29.760 --> 23:31.200
greet Mr. Fan.

23:31.280 --> 23:32.839
Mr. Hu, right?

23:33.280 --> 23:34.439
Can you tell me

23:34.760 --> 23:36.280
what place is this?

23:42.119 --> 23:43.320
Answer me.

23:45.000 --> 23:45.980
Mr. Fan,

23:46.000 --> 23:48.819
this is the Three Great Workshops'
warehouse of the Imperial Treasury.

23:48.839 --> 23:51.539
All goods of the Transportation Bureau
are stored here temporarily.

23:51.559 --> 23:53.500
I see.
This is the Three Great Workshops.

23:53.520 --> 23:55.040
Yes, the Three Great Workshops.

23:59.600 --> 24:01.540
Inspector Fan Xian
of the Imperial Inspectorate

24:01.560 --> 24:04.270
takes over the Three Great Workshops
under the imperial decree.

24:04.319 --> 24:05.440
His Majesty sends me for this duty.

24:05.440 --> 24:06.639
Everyone,

24:06.919 --> 24:08.560
do you have any objections?

24:13.720 --> 24:15.359
Do you have any?

24:15.910 --> 24:18.100
Mr. Fan, you are acting
according to the imperial decree.

24:18.120 --> 24:19.510
Three Great Workshops
of the Imperial Treasury

24:19.520 --> 24:21.310
will be handed over control as decreed.

24:29.800 --> 24:33.040
Count yourself lucky
that you didn't kill lives.

24:35.980 --> 24:37.140
Are there any iron smelting tools

24:37.159 --> 24:38.980
in the Three Great Workshops?

24:39.000 --> 24:39.540
Yes.

24:39.560 --> 24:41.059
They are all gathered in a warehouse.

24:41.079 --> 24:41.940
Show me the way.

24:41.960 --> 24:43.040
Yes.

24:43.559 --> 24:44.500
Move aside.

24:44.520 --> 24:45.299
Move.

24:45.319 --> 24:46.399
Move.

24:49.440 --> 24:50.520
Mr. Fan.

25:22.599 --> 25:24.839
Fan Xian entered the warehouse

25:25.119 --> 25:26.619
and hasn't come out since then?

25:26.639 --> 25:27.719
Yes.

25:27.760 --> 25:29.000
The door is closed.

25:29.079 --> 25:30.839
But they heard

25:31.040 --> 25:32.220
the sound of hammering iron

25:32.240 --> 25:33.460
and furnace burning.

25:33.480 --> 25:35.839
But they can't figure out
what he is doing inside.

25:36.720 --> 25:38.119
It's fine anyway.

25:39.080 --> 25:41.340
Even if the Three Great Workshops
are surrendered,

25:41.559 --> 25:43.480
as long as Ye Liuyun takes action,

25:43.520 --> 25:44.960
Fan Xian

25:46.000 --> 25:47.599
will die.

25:48.839 --> 25:50.720
What if he doesn't?

25:52.350 --> 25:54.310
The person he is against
is a grandmaster.

25:55.839 --> 25:57.320
You are the head of the family.

25:57.800 --> 25:59.359
You need to know this.

25:59.599 --> 26:02.040
Do not lay hope on others.

26:04.919 --> 26:06.960
What will happen

26:07.159 --> 26:08.760
if Fan Xian doesn't die?

26:11.560 --> 26:13.439
The entire Ming family will be executed

26:13.919 --> 26:15.960
for competing
for the Three Great Workshops.

26:16.720 --> 26:18.320
Who says it's the Ming family?

26:22.879 --> 26:23.960
Right.

26:24.319 --> 26:26.040
The Ming family is a victim.

26:27.240 --> 26:29.520
Someone betrayed the family.

26:33.520 --> 26:36.079
If that's the case,

26:36.399 --> 26:38.280
even if we adopt another kin,

26:39.280 --> 26:40.560
I'm afraid we can't cope

26:41.319 --> 26:42.839
with a serious crime like this.

26:42.960 --> 26:44.940
You have lots of blood brothers.

26:44.960 --> 26:47.139
You can sacrifice them

26:47.159 --> 26:49.560
one by one!

27:11.240 --> 27:12.520
Calm down, Mother.

27:13.280 --> 27:14.919
Whether they were

27:15.119 --> 27:16.839
to sacrifice one by one

27:17.520 --> 27:20.260
or all together depends on you.

27:20.280 --> 27:22.000
Be that as it may,

27:24.319 --> 27:25.839
we can't cope with the charge.

27:27.200 --> 27:29.159
That's easy.

27:29.319 --> 27:30.879
Between you and me,

27:31.240 --> 27:33.560
one will be chosen to sacrifice.

27:44.359 --> 27:45.760
Needless to say, it will be me.

27:50.879 --> 27:51.960
Even though

27:52.720 --> 27:54.439
how much I cherish my life,

27:58.800 --> 28:00.359
I'm still human.

28:03.559 --> 28:09.720
How could I sacrifice
my compassion and charitable mother?

28:13.520 --> 28:15.000
My good son.

28:17.639 --> 28:19.839
Don't make the choice just yet.

28:19.919 --> 28:23.200
We will see if Fan Xian survives.

28:31.359 --> 28:32.679
Mother, you are right.

28:35.079 --> 28:36.839
But this time, Fan Xian

28:52.839 --> 28:54.720
will have to die.

29:18.359 --> 29:19.800
It has been quite a while.

29:20.000 --> 29:21.059
I don't understand.

29:21.079 --> 29:22.060
How can he manage

29:22.080 --> 29:24.099
to create a powerful weapon
to attack a grandmaster

29:24.119 --> 29:25.359
in such a short time?

29:30.159 --> 29:31.239
Mr. Fan.

29:33.840 --> 29:35.630
Attention, Black Cavalries!
Defend the Three Great Workshops.

29:35.639 --> 29:36.800
Without my order, no one is allowed it.

29:36.800 --> 29:37.920
Yes!

29:39.200 --> 29:40.439
Has Ye Liuyun arrived?

29:40.839 --> 29:41.980
Are you that eager?

29:42.000 --> 29:43.059
He's almost here.

29:43.079 --> 29:44.439
I will go and greet him.

29:45.559 --> 29:46.639
Mr. Fan.

29:48.440 --> 29:49.520
Mr. Fan.

29:49.839 --> 29:52.660
I have never seen someone rush
to greet a grandmaster.

29:52.680 --> 29:53.919
Mr. Fan

29:54.000 --> 29:55.760
is not anyone.

29:56.870 --> 29:58.480
You actually complimenting him?

29:59.159 --> 30:00.139
Are you insane?

30:00.159 --> 30:01.639
Being insane once in a while

30:02.079 --> 30:03.639
can be quite thrilling.

30:04.000 --> 30:05.720
Mr. Fan, wait for me!

30:10.359 --> 30:11.639
They are insane.

30:26.000 --> 30:27.480
Waiter, a pot of tea.

30:38.639 --> 30:39.839
Mr. Shadow?

30:40.440 --> 30:41.879
You came here too.

30:43.159 --> 30:45.119
It's pretty good to join the fun.

30:45.119 --> 30:47.280
If you don't know what to say,

30:47.319 --> 30:48.919
then don't say.

30:50.720 --> 30:52.000
I'm nervous.

30:52.200 --> 30:53.639
I have to say something.

30:54.639 --> 30:55.719
Mr. Fan,

30:55.919 --> 30:59.079
do I have time to go to the loo now?

31:01.520 --> 31:03.000
I don't think so.

31:06.720 --> 31:07.800
What's wrong?

31:08.839 --> 31:10.310
What's wrong with the horse?

31:10.919 --> 31:12.839
Ye Liuyun is here.

31:47.320 --> 31:59.639
♪ An instant bloom of waves ♪

32:01.680 --> 32:10.639
♪ Has no difference ♪

32:10.639 --> 32:11.270
Don't follow me.

32:11.290 --> 32:12.639
I will handle it myself.

32:13.119 --> 32:14.399
Going alone is suicidal.

32:14.399 --> 32:18.040
♪ From millennia stone ♪

32:18.040 --> 32:19.120
Well.

32:19.520 --> 32:20.600
If you die,

32:20.879 --> 32:21.899
I will pick up your body.

32:21.919 --> 32:22.899
I beg to differ.

32:22.919 --> 32:24.520
If I really die,

32:24.760 --> 32:26.240
there won't be any remains.

32:27.319 --> 32:27.800
Mr. Fan.

32:27.800 --> 32:32.960
♪ Just like the drifting cloud ♪

32:32.960 --> 32:34.040
Wang,

32:34.639 --> 32:36.800
you are always smart.

32:36.919 --> 32:38.040
You can run fast.

32:38.599 --> 32:40.280
If anything happens later,

32:41.319 --> 32:42.679
don't do silly things.

32:47.240 --> 32:48.359
Mr. Fan.

33:16.599 --> 33:17.760
What does that mean?

33:18.000 --> 33:19.899
I might not defeat Grandmasters
even with this?

33:19.919 --> 33:20.999
Exactly.

33:21.440 --> 33:23.059
Grandmasters are human.

33:23.079 --> 33:25.240
How can they possibly dodge
an advanced weapon?

33:26.000 --> 33:27.420
Grandmasters

33:27.440 --> 33:29.599
aren't held back
by the usual limitations.

33:30.480 --> 33:31.639
Doesn't that make them monsters?

33:31.639 --> 33:39.940
♪ Has no difference ♪

33:49.000 --> 33:50.839
What's going on?

33:57.200 --> 33:58.320
Over there.

34:02.520 --> 34:04.119
It's coming.

34:12.680 --> 34:13.999
Amazing.

34:17.850 --> 34:19.120
[Ye Liuyun, grandmaster]

34:19.120 --> 34:20.840
[Ye Liuyun, grandmaster]
Fan Xian.

34:25.720 --> 34:27.359
Greetings, Mr. Ye.

34:30.479 --> 34:32.399
I owe someone a favor.

34:33.359 --> 34:35.519
I won't kill you if you leave Jiangnan.

34:36.640 --> 34:37.800
Sorry,

34:38.439 --> 34:40.280
I don't really take advice.

34:43.839 --> 34:46.800
What were you looking at just now?

34:48.319 --> 34:49.919
A powerful weapon.

34:52.479 --> 34:53.959
Why aren't you using that?

34:55.760 --> 34:57.080
I thought to myself

34:57.120 --> 34:58.320
and figured

34:58.399 --> 34:59.559
that I didn't need it.

35:02.919 --> 35:04.120
How so?

35:05.879 --> 35:08.120
You won't kill me.

35:25.640 --> 35:29.479
I gather you are known
for your Drifting Cloud Hand Techniques.

35:30.999 --> 35:32.680
Swords

35:33.120 --> 35:34.320
can kill faster.

35:35.680 --> 35:37.760
Why won't I kill you?

35:38.080 --> 35:40.280
Because you daren't.

35:40.760 --> 35:42.060
All over the world,

35:42.080 --> 35:44.979
unless someone ruthless like Sigu Jian,

35:44.999 --> 35:46.080
no one

35:46.479 --> 35:48.399
dares kill me.

35:49.319 --> 35:50.459
Are you sure?

35:50.479 --> 35:52.419
The Ye family is ousted
from the Capital,

35:52.439 --> 35:54.680
but it still stands,

35:55.720 --> 35:57.160
and hasn't collapsed yet.

35:57.359 --> 35:59.479
If you really kill me,

35:59.640 --> 36:00.839
the Ye family

36:00.999 --> 36:03.479
will fall apart.

36:08.479 --> 36:09.999
So this gives you

36:11.160 --> 36:12.559
confidence?

36:13.640 --> 36:16.180
You are like a drifting cloud
in the sky.

36:16.200 --> 36:17.720
Without constraints.

36:18.039 --> 36:18.879
But for so many years,

36:18.879 --> 36:21.160
you have left an attachment down here,

36:21.680 --> 36:24.180
which still makes you human.

36:24.200 --> 36:25.519
And so,

36:25.800 --> 36:27.320
you are attached.

36:27.879 --> 36:29.200
Waves bloom in an instant

36:29.200 --> 36:30.999
but they are no different

36:31.560 --> 36:33.240
from a millennia rock.

36:33.680 --> 36:36.479
So it is with you, Mr. Ye.

36:40.200 --> 36:41.879
Who told you

36:42.479 --> 36:44.359
I care about the Ye family?

36:54.919 --> 36:56.240
What was that?

37:03.640 --> 37:05.160
Continue to eat the dishes.

37:23.919 --> 37:24.999
Mr. Ye,

37:25.479 --> 37:27.160
I win the bet.

37:27.439 --> 37:29.039
You are a grandmaster,

37:29.200 --> 37:30.879
but you are still human.

37:31.600 --> 37:33.160
What a gambler.

37:33.519 --> 37:34.879
This is insane.

37:36.039 --> 37:38.160
I wonder who you take after.

37:40.879 --> 37:42.320
Thank you, Mr. Ye.

37:44.999 --> 37:46.439
Just this one time.

37:46.760 --> 37:48.559
It won't happen again.

37:48.800 --> 37:51.640
I thank you for showing me

37:51.959 --> 37:54.959
that even a grandmaster
can still be human.

37:56.680 --> 37:58.019
In my life,

37:58.039 --> 38:00.280
I pursue politics and martial arts.

38:00.359 --> 38:03.120
If both of them lose humanity

38:03.200 --> 38:04.800
in the end,

38:05.760 --> 38:07.399
it's pointless for me.

38:20.640 --> 38:22.919
You are so different from your mother.

38:23.280 --> 38:24.720
You are sentimental.

38:25.640 --> 38:26.959
You knew her?

38:27.160 --> 38:28.959
She is not like you.

38:30.879 --> 38:32.160
Smart.

38:33.039 --> 38:35.080
But not too smart.

38:35.999 --> 38:37.399
What does that mean?

38:37.879 --> 38:39.280
I'm human,

38:39.959 --> 38:42.359
but that doesn't mean other grandmasters

38:42.959 --> 38:45.320
see themselves in the same way.

39:27.439 --> 39:28.519
Mr. Fan,

39:28.680 --> 39:31.359
everything is over, right?

39:33.200 --> 39:34.479
We won.

39:35.519 --> 39:37.760
How did you know he wouldn't kill you?

39:39.399 --> 39:41.039
I bet my life on that.

39:41.760 --> 39:42.780
Congrats.

39:42.800 --> 39:44.039
You won.

39:45.479 --> 39:46.600
One more question.

39:46.999 --> 39:48.499
Since he didn't kill you,

39:48.519 --> 39:49.859
why did he

39:49.879 --> 39:51.200
wield the sword?

39:51.959 --> 39:53.339
To show the Capital.

39:53.359 --> 39:54.240
The Ye family was exiled,

39:54.240 --> 39:55.419
which upset him.

39:55.439 --> 39:58.479
He expressed his attitude
with that slash.

39:59.720 --> 40:01.660
But when he wielded at me,

40:01.680 --> 40:03.660
I felt an earthquake.

40:03.680 --> 40:06.280
At that moment, I thought I was dead.

40:07.640 --> 40:09.160
Unexpectedly,

40:09.439 --> 40:11.120
he just cut my hair.

40:15.270 --> 40:16.680
What is this happening?

40:16.720 --> 40:17.399
Why?

40:17.399 --> 40:19.320
What... What is going on?

40:48.519 --> 40:50.320
Splitting a building with a slash.

40:51.319 --> 40:53.399
That's what a grandmaster can do.

40:54.439 --> 40:55.760
Grandmasters

40:55.959 --> 40:57.559
are truly not human.

40:58.120 --> 41:00.320
It sounds like an insult.

41:09.600 --> 41:10.919
You said that wrong.

41:12.200 --> 41:13.640
Actually, they are

41:14.359 --> 41:15.720
still human.

41:17.560 --> 41:20.039
Do you think this could happen for us?

41:24.720 --> 41:26.080
I might.

41:27.319 --> 41:28.399
What about me?

41:29.280 --> 41:30.400
Mr. Fan,

41:30.680 --> 41:33.240
only when your qi recovers.

41:58.999 --> 42:00.359
I'm back.

42:03.025 --> 42:06.220
[End of This Season]

42:21.319 --> 42:23.080
It's not over yet.

42:23.560 --> 42:25.140
Don't tell me

42:25.160 --> 42:27.240
I have to wait for years again
for the end.

42:29.690 --> 42:31.220
Library is closing.

42:31.240 --> 42:34.439
Please take your personal effects
and exit in an orderly manner.

42:35.200 --> 42:39.240
Shadow hurt Fan Xian so badly,
and he's not doing anything?

42:41.479 --> 42:42.680
What about Yuan Meng?

42:42.760 --> 42:44.519
Lives are killed because of her.

42:47.519 --> 42:50.680
What exactly is the relationship between
Emperor Qing and the Divine Temple?

42:54.360 --> 42:55.800
[May all the endurance be worthwhile]
Spend things up,

42:55.801 --> 42:56.839
[May hardships not diminish your spirit]
please?

42:56.839 --> 42:58.750
[Fan Xian chose a path without
compromises. We hope the same for you.]

42:58.750 --> 43:01.270
[Having you all along has been
a joy in life. See you in Season 3.]

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.640
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.660 --> 44:10.900
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.320
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.340 --> 44:32.260
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.480
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.150 --> 44:58.620
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.870 --> 45:02.010
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.160 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.900 --> 45:20.100
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
